# dist is committed, not ignored, for as long as this package is consumed by
# git URL. npm runs `prepare` when it packs a git dependency, but a consumer
# that installs with --ignore-scripts (Nix's buildNpmPackage does) never gets
# that build. Publishing to npm makes the tarball carry dist and this line
# can go back to ignoring it.
*.tsbuildinfo
node_modules/
